<<dl "\"Ek khaansi   galat angle. Do khaansi   ho gaya nuksaan. Haath apne haath pe   sahi position. Aur agar main naak pochhun toh matlab Sharma peeche aa raha hai.\"" "One cough   wrong angle. Two coughs   damage done. Hand on my own hand   correct position. And if I wipe my nose, Sharma's coming up behind you.">>

"We built a dissection API."

<<dl "\"Hum engineers hain. Galat department mein bhi, hum engineer karte hain.\"" "We're engineers. Even in the wrong department, we engineer.">>
